  "ruleText": "Env-A 3002.29 \"Real\" means \"real\" as defined in RSA 125-J:1,XXVI, namely \"the reduction in baseline emissions from an ERC emission source released into the air.\"\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
